    "detailed_description": "Create your very own tiny planet and place it among the stars in the vast expanse of the universe !<br><br>Transform it into your desktop wallpaper or leave it on one of your screen like a digital aquarium \u2013 the decision is entirely yours.<br>And once you've created it, share it with the world online, and see the incredible creations others have brought to life.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> create / read / update / delete blocks to build your tiny planet<br></li><li> multiple texture to chose from for your different blocks</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c72b4be810c431b50d5b5348a96325b7.poster.avif?t=1712634397\" width=512 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c72b4be810c431b50d5b5348a96325b7.webm?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c72b4be810c431b50d5b5348a96325b7.mp4?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> upload and share your creation with the world (join the subreddit TinyPlanetz and post your creation on there !)<br></li><li> visit other people's creation by entering specifics coordinates</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/2801eab4d953c8aef5ad83595b03c76d.poster.avif?t=1712634397\" width=512 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/2801eab4d953c8aef5ad83595b03c76d.webm?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/2801eab4d953c8aef5ad83595b03c76d.mp4?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> night and day system to simulate the passage of time</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/e5c3af9ddaadbab1108ae96cef30376a.poster.avif?t=1712634397\" width=640 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/e5c3af9ddaadbab1108ae96cef30376a.webm?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/e5c3af9ddaadbab1108ae96cef30376a.mp4?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> save and load your creation locally</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c09081b9cc481d74e32cf9a05e1db915.poster.avif?t=1712634397\" width=640 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c09081b9cc481d74e32cf9a05e1db915.webm?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886880/extras/c09081b9cc481d74e32cf9a05e1db915.mp4?t=1712634397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
